{
  "id": "v6iKF6Tahvrk4Lpu",
  "name": "Almutawa - Daily Backup to GitHub",
  "description": "Daily automated backup workflow: lists all n8n workflows via the API, exports each one's full JSON, and commits it to the GitHub repo m-almutawa22/ai-hub under n8n-backups/, updating existing files or creating new ones. Sends a Telegram summary to the off",
